      modelAnswer: '(a) Dhá shaintréith (glactar le haon dá cheann díobh seo): (1) is oileáin iad a bhfuil cónaí buan orthu ar feadh na bliana (they are lived on permanently all year round); (2) níl siad ceangailte leis an mórthír le droichead nó le cabhsa (they are not linked to the mainland by a bridge or causeway); (3) níl siad faoi úinéireacht phríobháideach (they are not in private ownership). De réir an scéime marcála, an chéad saintréith atá ceart = 2 mharc, an dara ceann = 1 mharc. (b)(i) Is é aidhm an pholasaí ná a chinntiú go gcothófar pobail bheoga, inbhuanaithe ar na hoileáin agus go mbeidh saol faoi rath acu go ceann blianta fada (to ensure that vibrant, sustainable communities are fostered on the islands and that they will thrive for many years to come). Tagann gach pointe go díreach as Alt 1 den sliocht.',
