      text: 'In LC French HL 2023 Q1 5(b), \'Pourquoi les hôtels de luxe offrent-ils des prix réduits ?\', the scheme gives \'Pour (offrir) une expérience inoubliable\' = 5/5. But stopping at \'Pour (offrir) une expérience\' — dropping the key word \'inoubliable\' — collapses to 2/5, because the \'unforgettable\' bit is the actual reason. A second 5/5 answer was \'Parce qu\'ils évitent que des chambres ne restent inoccupées\'. Lesson: for Pourquoi, carry the FULL purpose / cause, not just its first half. (Note: a clean restatement that keeps the purpose — e.g. an imperfect \'Ils cherchaient...\' — can also score 5; you don\'t have to start with \'Pour\' or \'Parce que\', but you must keep the whole reason.)',
