    source: 'Light (Mirrors) — SEC LC Physics 2024 Ordinary Level, Q8 parts (v),(vii),(viii) + marking scheme (ray diagram: incident ray [3], first reflected ray [3], second reflected ray [3], image formed [2]; m = 40/20 = 2; image height 5 × 2 = 10 cm)',
