    source: 'Topic: The United States and the World, 1945-1989; Case Study: The Moon Landing 1969 — SEC LC History 2023 HL, Section 3 Topic 6 Q4 (\'How did the US achieve a successful moon landing in 1969, and what was its significance at home and abroad?\') + marking scheme (Max CM = 60, Max OE = 40; \'NOTE: TWO elements (how + significance) — If only ONE, Max. CM = 50\')',
